      "writtenOn": "2022-10-10T19:52:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is an accurate observation. It\u0027s a trade-off of \"do more builds\" to get \"make sure our minimal builds work on their own\". I think it\u0027s worth paying.\n\nIt is certainly something to keep an eye on, especially as we get to actually executing these on devices where sending the binaries is expensive timewise (e.g. Android).",
      "parentUuid": "ae861b41_6f5bb144",
      "revId": "12a3336151ada75d988ccad710923b6d56b0d0c4",
